    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.04.01",
    "summary": "A side panel beside the Disembark Move (18.04) covers a Rapid Disembark made because the unit's Transport made an Ingress move (Ingress Move, 20.04) earlier: the disembarking models are held to the same rules and restrictions that bound the Transport during that move. Its worked example: where the Transport had to be placed more than 8\" away from every enemy unit and outside the opponent's deployment zone, the unit that disembarks must meet both requirements too.",
